Package: AURATHOMALAB10
Title: Maximum Likelihood Estimation, Newton-Raphson Optimization, and Bootstrap Intervals
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Aura", "Thoma",
      email = "aurathoma@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides custom statistical computing functions for maximum likelihood 
    estimation (MLE) via grid search, root-finding using the Newton-Raphson algorithm 
    with numerical derivatives, and bootstrap resampling confidence intervals. Also 
    includes an interactive Shiny application for exploring bootstrap distributions.
